Configuring Jenkins Plugins
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Install and configure Jenkins plugins to extend functionality
Set up the Docker plugin and integrate it into Jenkins pipelines
Configure the Maven plugin for Java project builds
Create and execute Jenkins pipelines using Docker and Maven plugins
Understand plugin management best practices in Jenkins
Troubleshoot common plugin configuration issues
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic understanding of Jenkins fundamentals
Familiarity with Linux command line operations
Basic knowledge of Docker concepts
Understanding of Java and Maven build processes
Experience with Jenkins pipeline syntax (Groovy)
Completion of previous Jenkins labs or equivalent knowledge
