Troubleshooting Common Issues
Docker Permission Issues
If you encounter Docker permission errors:

# Add current user to docker group
sudo usermod -aG docker $USER
sudo usermod -aG docker jenkins

# Restart Jenkins service
sudo systemctl restart jenkins

# Test Docker access
sudo -u jenkins docker ps
Maven Build Failures
For Maven-related issues:

# Check Maven configuration
mvn help:system

# Clear Maven cache
rm -rf ~/.m2/repository

# Check Java version compatibility
java -version
javac -version
Jenkins Plugin Issues
If plugins fail to install:

# Restart Jenkins
sudo systemctl restart jenkins

# Check Jenkins logs
sudo journalctl -u jenkins -f

# Manual plugin installation
sudo wget -O /var/lib/jenkins/plugins/docker-workflow.hpi https://updates.jenkins.io/latest/docker-workflow.hpi
sudo chown jenkins:jenkins /var/lib/jenkins/plugins/docker-workflow.hpi
sudo systemctl restart jenkins
Memory Issues
If builds fail due to memory constraints:

# Increase Jenkins memory
sudo systemctl edit jenkins

# Add the following content:
[Service]
Environment="JAVA_OPTS=-Xmx2048m -XX:MaxPermSize=512m"

# Restart Jenkins
sudo systemctl restart jenkins
